Genotype data were simulated using HAPGEN2 (33) based on the 99 FIN haplotypes of chromosome 22 from the 1000 Genomes Project data (phase3, GRCh37) (34). The simulated genotypes had similar LD patterns with the reference data. Six sets of genotype data were generated at varying sample sizes: 100, 200, 500, 1000, 2000 and 5000 individuals. After filtering out SNPs with MAF <0.5% or Hardy–Weinberg equilibrium P-value <5 \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
